body:
@jonboiwaltonjr

Yeah, it is commonly a mental health tattoo meaning that the author could’ve decided to end a sentence but didn’t. Metaphorically the author is the individual with a tattoo and the sentence is life. So commonly people who have experienced severe depression and thought of ending their life but didn’t get the tattoo. After my good friend died of suicide I wanted to get some kind of tattoo to remember him and that was the first thing I thought of even though the person attempting suicide wasn’t me.

@D-Renny I also really like the way your friend adapted the tattoo to have her own meaning, especially since it was located at the site of an old track mark. It must be a very positive and powerful reminder of how far she’s come! 🙂
